# OXA BANK — Validation Checklist

## Layer 2
- [ ] `show vlan brief`
- [ ] `show interfaces trunk`
- [ ] `show spanning-tree summary`
- [ ] `show spanning-tree vlan <vlan-id>`
- [ ] `show port-security interface <interface>`

## Layer 3 / HSRP / RIPv2
- [ ] `show ip interface brief`
- [ ] `show ip route`
- [ ] `show ip protocols`
- [ ] `show ip rip database`
- [ ] `show standby brief`

## Services / Edge
- [ ] Client receives DHCP address from expected VLAN pool
- [ ] Client resolves `dns.oxabank.local`
- [ ] Client reaches its HSRP gateway
- [ ] Client reaches DNS/DHCP server as permitted
- [ ] NAT/PAT translations appear on R5
- [ ] Simulated external target `8.8.8.8` responds

## Security
- [ ] Guest cannot reach internal bank subnets
- [ ] ATM access is limited to approved networks
- [ ] DMZ cannot initiate new connections to internal networks
- [ ] Finance cannot reach Backup
- [ ] Approved IT/Admin sources can reach Backup

## Redundancy
- [ ] One Active and one Standby peer per HSRP group
- [ ] HSRP failover succeeds
- [ ] Routing reconverges after a routed-link failure

## Configuration caveats to resolve
- [ ] Configure local credentials and authenticated VTY login before relying on SSH
- [ ] Add the optional physical links before enabling LACP EtherChannel
- [ ] Deploy a DMZ web server at `10.10.160.10` if testing the `www` DNS record
